  "title": "Mini Lemon Meringue Tarts",
  "description": "This mini lemon meringue tarts recipe yields a light-textured, not too sweet filling with buttermilk and lemon zest. Frozen shells are a handy shortcut.",
  "authors": [
    "Leslie O'Ray-Curnew"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:41:04-04:00",
